  Offensive Rebound: 77.1% on 35 attempts; Cut: 60.9% on 110 attempts
  Each is 5+ points above their 40.5% overall clip on 15+ attempts. Offensive Rebound: hit a body on every shot before going to the ball. Cut: jump to the ball on every pass and see man and ball -- no back-cuts behind ball-watchers.

